{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[A7]Sha[Dm]lom, my friends, shalom, my friends
[Dm]Sha[Gm]lom, [Am7]sha[Dm]lom.
[Dm]May peace be with you, God’s peace be with you.
[Dm]Sha[Gm]lom, [A7]sha[Dm]lom.
{end_of_verse}
